From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jan 2025 07:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: mt7988: fix tops uart group names

Use the correct "tops_uart0_1" and "tops_uart1_1" group names in the
UART function group list.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt7988.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt7988.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt7988.c
@@ -1209,1 +1209,1 @@ static const char *const mt7988_uart_groups[] = { "uart2", "tops_uart0_0",
-	"tops_uart1_0", "ops_uart0_1", "ops_uart1_1",
+	"tops_uart1_0", "tops_uart0_1", "tops_uart1_1",
